### Sub-task 3: Rewire Endpoint `recommendations/majors`

#### [MODIFY] [RecommendationService.php](file:///d:/laragon/www/nesaiBackend/app/Services/RecommendationService.php)

Mengganti stub kosong dengan logic yang **menggunakan kembali scoring engine** dari `RecommendJurusanTool` (diextract ke trait/helper shared):

```
POST /api/v1/recommendations/majors
Body: { "interests": ["komputer", "game", "desain"] }

Response: {
    "data": [
        { "nama": "PPLG", "skor": 5, "alasan": "...", "prospek_karir": [...] },
        ...
    ],
    "meta": { "status": "scored" }
}
```

> [!NOTE]
> Logic scoring **tidak di-duplikasi** — akan diextract ke sebuah class helper (`App\Ai\Support\JurusanScorer`) yang dipakai oleh `RecommendJurusanTool` dan `RecommendationService`.

